    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B07b scope (observability & queues)","items":["Part of B07-guardrails-ops split. Modules: health (6/2), monitoring (4/1), platform-metrics (3/1), audit-log (6/1), queue-admin (17/2), admin-rate-limit (13/1) = 49 routes / 8 controllers.","Health/metrics: public /health plus admin health services, monitoring, platform metrics. Audit: /admin/audit-logs. Queue admin: /admin/queues and /admin/schedulers. Rate limit: /admin/rate-limit.","Grouped endpoint nodes for readability."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Health: GET /health and admin health/service endpoints -> liveness/readiness/service health status payloads.","Monitoring/platform metrics: admin metric/session/usage queries -> observability payloads; platform metrics may query Prometheus-backed data (implementation-dependent).","Queue/scheduler admin: list/inspect/retry/pause/resume/clean/drain style operations -> queue/scheduler/job state (BullMQ/runtime dependent). Verify destructive operation safeguards.","Audit/rate limit: audit log query/export -> audit records; rate-limit rule/settings CRUD -> effective rate-limit configuration. Verify sensitive-field redaction and access controls."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controllers verified; platform-metrics and rate-limit service classes verified.","Downstreams: ops/config data stores (Postgres/Prisma), observability infra (Prometheus/metrics), queue runtime (Redis/BullMQ) and health dependencies.","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (49 routes/8 controllers); audit-log, health, monitoring, and queue-admin application service implementation paths not all separately verified in this pass; reconcile exact route/DTO contracts and destructive queue/rate-limit operations with OpenAPI/implementation."]}
